Package: tflplanner
Type: Package
Title: 'shiny' Study Manager for Clinical Tables, Listings and Figures
Version: 0.0.2.9257
Authors@R: c(
    person(given  = "Yoichi",
           family = "Masui",
           email  = "ichi.r.pro@gmail.com",
           role   = c("aut", "cre", "cph")))
Description: A 'shiny' study manager for clinical tables, listings and
    figures made with 'rtfreporter'. Each study is a folder of its own --
    input data, definitions, programs, results and the records of its
    official runs. The app defines the study's analysis results data (ARD)
    and writes one 'cards' / 'cardx' program per output, which together
    make one study ARD; it defines the tables, listings and figures and
    writes one program per report, which reads its part of the study ARD
    (or the 'SDTM' / 'ADaM' data) and writes the report's RTF. Official
    runs keep each program's log, what it made and the code it ran in a
    dated batch folder. Defaults and code lists come from a company's
    standards workbook.
